  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%A8%EC%82%B0%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C%EA%B4%80-%ED%99%98%EC%83%9D-%EB%B6%81%ED%81%B4%EB%9F%BD/2835), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60746431)\n\nJun-ha' has been appointed as a librarian at Namsan Library.\n\nOn the first day of Joon-ha's appointment, he meets 'Summer', who lives hidden in the library.\n\nSummer died in Namsan in 1999, but a special existence that remains as it was at the time. The secret to such a summer to maintain its human form is reading books.\n\nIf you feel emotions while reading a book, you can think and act like a living person. Even Summer, who seems like an ordinary person at first glance, has one peculiarity: Summer cannot interact with people born after 1999, when she died, or objects made.\n\nHowever, Jun-ha is an exception.\n\nJunha was born after he died, so why can't we see each other? Summer thinks that Joon-ha is the key to reincarnation, and tries to entice him into a book reading group.\n\nHowever, Joon-ha is not interested in Summer's proposal.\n\nIn the meantime, he finds out that Joon-ha had a relationship with Summer in the past.\n\nGo, as Summer's reincarnation, reveals her dark past\n\nI hope to see that it can be corrected.\n\nThis is how the two people's Namsan Library Reincarnation Book Club begins.",
